<PageLayout title="Corporate Events Venue — The Forktree Project" description="Host your next corporate event, off-siter or team-building day at The Forktree Project's restored shearing shed with modern amenities, rustic charm and panoramic ocean views.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="ce-hero" style="background-image: url('/images/corporate-events/img_4690.jpg'); background-color: #2a3a2a;">
    <div class="ce-hero__content">
      <h1>Corporate Events Venue</h1>
      <p class="ce-hero__tagline"><span class="ce-hero__tagline-text">A tastefully restored shearing shed with modern amenities, rustic charm and panoramic ocean views</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="ce-hero__scroll">
      <svg width="20" height="12" viewBox="0 0 20 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <path d="M1 1L10 10L19 1" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="ce-section ce-section--intro" style="background-image: url('/images/corporate-events/img_4693.jpg'); background-color: #1a2a1a;">
    <div class="ce-section__content ce-section__content--center">
      <div class="ce-text ce-text--wide">
        <p>Come and have your next corporate event, off-siter, strategy session or team-building day at The Forktree Project, with our tastefully restored shearing shed offering a wonderful combination of modern amenities, rustic charm and panoramic views of the ocean.</p>
        <p>Perfect surroundings to talk strategy or re-energise your team.</p>
        <p class="ce-text__location">One hour from Adelaide CBD &mdash; going against the flow of traffic!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Facilities -->
  <section class="ce-section ce-section--facilities" style="background-image: url('/images/corporate-events/img_4701.jpg'); background-color: #2a3a2a;">
    <div class="ce-section__content ce-section__content--left">
      <div class="ce-text">
        <h2>Facilities</h2>
        <ul class="ce-list">
          <li><span class="ce-list__icon" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span> Wifi throughout</li>
          <li><span class="ce-list__icon" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span> 3 wheelchair-accessible toilets/bathrooms</li>
          <li><span class="ce-list__icon" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span> Wheelchair access throughout</li>
          <li><span class="ce-list__icon" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span> Main lecture room for up to 30 people with AV facilities</li>
          <li><span class="ce-list__icon" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span> 4 break-out rooms for smaller groups</li>
          <li><span class="ce-list__icon" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span> Open plan kitchen and common room for onsite catering with tea and coffee-making facilities, microwave, fridge and oven</li>
          <li><span class="ce-list__icon" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span> Covered verandah with sea views to take time out or run sessions outside</li>
          <li><span class="ce-list__icon" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span> BBQ and pizza oven</li>
          <li><span class="ce-list__icon" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span> Ample on-site parking</li>
          <li><span class="ce-list__icon" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span> A range of experiential activities involving nursery work or tree planting available upon request</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Photo Gallery -->
  <section class="ce-gallery">
    <div class="ce-gallery__inner">
      <h2>Our Venue</h2>
      <div class="ce-gallery__featured">
        <a href={`/images/corporate-events/${photos[0]}`} class="ce-gallery__hero-img" target="_blank">
          <img src={`/images/corporate-events/${photos[0]}`} alt="The Forktree Project venue" loading="lazy" />
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="ce-gallery__grid" id="gallery-grid">
        {photos.slice(1, 8).map((photo) => (
          <a href={`/images/corporate-events/${photo}`} class="ce-gallery__item" target="_blank">
            <img src={`/images/corporate-events/${photo}`} alt="The Forktree Project venue" loading="lazy" />
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="ce-gallery__overflow" id="gallery-overflow">
        {photos.slice(8).map((photo) => (
          <a href={`/images/corporate-events/${photo}`} class="ce-gallery__item" target="_blank">
            <img src={`/images/corporate-events/${photo}`} alt="The Forktree Project venue" loading="lazy" />
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
      <button class="ce-gallery__toggle" id="gallery-toggle" type="button">
        View all {photos.length} photos
      </button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
    const toggle = document.getElementById('gallery-toggle');
    const overflow = document.getElementById('gallery-overflow');
    if (toggle && overflow) {
      toggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const expanded = overflow.classList.toggle('ce-gallery__overflow--visible');
        toggle.textContent = expanded ? 'Show fewer photos' : `View all ${overflow.querySelectorAll('a').length + 8} photos`;
      });
    }
  </script>

  <!-- Testimonials -->
  <section class="ce-section ce-section--testimonials" style="background-image: url('/images/corporate-events/img_4656.jpg'); background-color: #1a2a1a;">
    <div class="ce-section__content ce-section__content--center">
      <div class="ce-testimonials">
        <h2>What People Are Saying</h2>
        <div class="ce-testimonials__grid">

          <blockquote class="ce-testimonial-card">
            <div class="ce-testimonial-card__quote" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</div>
            <div class="ce-testimonial-card__body">
              <p>We recently hosted a corporate event for 30 people at the Forktree Project and it exceeded our expectations in every respect. The thoughtfully renovated farmhouse, featuring an expansive deck with stunning ocean views, has been beautifully crafted using recycled and environmentally sustainable materials. The meeting room offers an excellent setting for focused, productive work, while the generous breakout spaces provide a seamless and spacious connection with the surrounding natural landscape. With its breathtaking outlook and purpose-designed spaces, the Forktree Project is a compelling alternative to a traditional corporate function centre.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ce-testimonial-card__divider"></div>
            <cite class="ce-testimonial-card__cite">Nicole Gaunt<span>Operations Officer, Pew Charitable Trusts</span></cite>
          </blockquote>

          <blockquote class="ce-testimonial-card">
            <div class="ce-testimonial-card__quote" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</div>
            <div class="ce-testimonial-card__body">
              <p>The Environment Protection Authority thanks the Forktree Project team for providing a meaningful setting for our senior leadership group at Forktree. The day offered a valuable opportunity to step outside our usual environment and reconnect with the land in a way that was practical, reflective and genuinely meaningful.</p>
              <p>Through expertly guided, hands-on nursery activities, time spent working with the soil, and shared conversations in a natural setting, leaders were encouraged to slow down, observe the impact of the season on the land, and engage with environmental stewardship at a human scale. The structure of the day supported thoughtful discussion while allowing space for connection and reflection.</p>
              <p>The experience reinforced the importance of grounding environmental leadership in real-world systems and care for land beyond the office or boardroom. It provided a shared reference point for reflection, learning and collective purpose.</p>
              <p>We extend our thanks to Tim, Liz, Fleur, and the Forktree team for the care, expertise and generosity they brought to the day. The team&rsquo;s thoughtful guidance and strong connection to place created an experience that will stay with our leaders well beyond the visit.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ce-testimonial-card__divider"></div>
            <cite class="ce-testimonial-card__cite">The Environment Protection Authority SA</cite>
          </blockquote>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="ce-section ce-section--cta" style="background-image: url('/images/corporate-events/img_4688.jpg'); background-color: #2a3a2a;">
    <div class="ce-section__content ce-section__content--center">
      <div class="ce-cta">
        <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
        <p>Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@theforktreeproject.com">hello@theforktreeproject.com</a> or call on <a href="tel:+61457492386">0457 492 386</a> for details.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PageLayout>

<style>
  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  /* Hero */
  .ce-hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-attachment: fixed;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ce-hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4) 40%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 60%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 100%);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ce-hero__content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    padding: 0 30px;
  }

  .ce-hero__content h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .ce-hero__tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.3rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ce-hero__tagline-text {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: inline-block;
    box-decoration-break: clone;
    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }

  .ce-hero__scroll {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 30px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    z-index: 2;
    opacity: 0.7;
    animation: bounceDown 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes bounceDown {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(8px); }
  }

  /* Sections */
  .ce-section {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-attachment: fixed;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ce-section::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ce-section__content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1600px;
    padding: 180px 100px;
  }

  .ce-section__content--center {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ce-section__content--left {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .ce-text {
    max-width: 50%;
    position: relative;
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .ce-text--wide {
    max-width: 750px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ce-text h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .ce-text p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 1.3vw, 1rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .ce-text p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .ce-text__location {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* Facilities list */
  .ce-list {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .ce-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 1.3vw, 1rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .ce-list__icon {
    color: #22c55e;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.95em;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 1em;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Gallery */
  .ce-gallery {
    background: #111;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    padding: 100px 60px;
  }

  .ce-gallery__inner {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ce-gallery__inner h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .ce-gallery__featured {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ce-gallery__hero-img {
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 6px;
    aspect-ratio: 21 / 9;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ce-gallery__hero-img img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.4s ease;
  }

  .ce-gallery__hero-img:hover img {
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }

  .ce-gallery__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ce-gallery__overflow {
    display: none;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .ce-gallery__overflow--visible {
    display: grid;
  }

  .ce-gallery__item {
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 4px;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
  }

  .ce-gallery__item img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.4s ease;
  }

  .ce-gallery__item:hover img {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .ce-gallery__toggle {
    display: block;
    margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
    padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
    background: transparent;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    color: white;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .ce-gallery__toggle:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
  }

  /* Testimonials */
  .ce-testimonials {
    max-width: 900px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ce-testimonials h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .ce-testimonials__grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .ce-testimonial-card {
    position: relative;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border-radius: 10px;
    border-left: 4px solid #16a34a;
    padding: 2rem 2rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  .ce-testimonial-card__quote {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 4rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #16a34a;
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin-bottom: -1rem;
  }

  .ce-testimonial-card__body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 1.2vw, 1rem);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.8;
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .ce-testimonial-card__body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .ce-testimonial-card__divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    margin: 1.25rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .ce-testimonial-card__cite {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    opacity: 0.85;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .ce-testimonial-card__cite span {
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .ce-section--cta {
    min-height: 60vh;
  }

  .ce-cta {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 600px;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .ce-cta h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .ce-cta p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.3vw, 1.1rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .ce-cta a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .ce-cta a:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ce-hero {
      background-attachment: scroll;
    }

    .ce-section {
      background-attachment: scroll;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .ce-section__content {
      padding: 80px 20px;
    }

    .ce-section__content--left,
    .ce-section__content--center {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .ce-text,
    .ce-text--wide {
      max-width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .ce-list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ce-gallery {
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    .ce-gallery__hero-img {
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    }

    .ce-gallery__grid,
    .ce-gallery__overflow {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(140px, 1fr));
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .ce-testimonial-card {
      padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .ce-testimonial-card__quote {
      font-size: 3rem;
    }

    .ce-section--cta {
      min-height: auto;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 769px) {
    .ce-list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.5rem 2rem;
    }

    .ce-text {
      max-width: 65%;
    }
  }
</style>
